           {
            "type": "SceneText",
            "sceneTextConfig": {
             "autoSizeText": false,
             "enableAutoRefresh": false,
             "enableSelection": false,
             "htmlFormatting": true,
             "isBold": false,
             "isItalic": false,
             "maxLines": "3",
             "maxLinesEnabled": false,
             "text": "<p+style=\"font-size:+{lv=fntSz632}px;\"><u>🔍+Search+Tab+Information:</u></p>\n",
             "textAlignment": "Center",
             "textColor": -1,
             "textSize": "16",
             "visibilityVariable": {
              "varName": "shwInfo534"
             }
            },
            "guid": -7969874835211112433,
            "iconRes": 2131232676,
            "lastRefreshValue": 0
           },
           {
            "type": "SceneText",
            "sceneTextConfig": {
             "autoSizeText": false,
             "enableAutoRefresh": false,
             "enableSelection": false,
             "htmlFormatting": false,
             "isBold": false,
             "isItalic": false,
             "maxLines": "3",
             "maxLinesEnabled": false,
             "text": "-Searching:\nYou+can+search+the+clipboard+log+for+keywords.+Additionally,+you+can+search+by+specific+dates+or+between+two+dates.+If+the+entered+date+is+not+found,+the+system+will+return+the+closest+matching+date.+The+search+may+take+longer+the+larger+the+log+gets.\n\n-+Delete+Mode:+\nTo+delete+an+entry,+hold+the+line+icon+in+the+top+corner+of+the+text+box+to+activate+delete+mode.+While+in+delete+mode,+a+\"Select+All\"+button+and+a+trash+can+icon+(\"🗑\")+will+appear+at+the+top+of+the+page.+Tap+an+entry+to+highlight+or+unhighlight+it+for+deletion.+Tap+the+trash+button+to+confirm+and+delete+the+selected+entries.It+will+delete+the+first+occurrence+of+a+duplicate+entry+unless+the+duplicates+are+also+highlighted.\n+\n-+Import+entry+into+clipboard:\nTap+the+entry+to+import+it+into+your+device's+clipboard.++\n\n-+Copyable+overlay:+\nHold+an+entry+to+activate+a+full-screen+overlay+of+the+entry.+This+is+useful+for+copying+specific+text+from+an+entry.++\n\n-+Scrollbar:\nOn+entry+boxes+with+large+text+entries+that+exceed+the+\"box+size\"+limit,+a+scrollbar+will+appear+on+the+side+of+the+textbox.+Use+this+to+scroll+the+text.\n++\n-+Turning+Pages:+\nThis+macro+retrieves+entries+from+the+file+in+chunks+to+prevent+system+overload+when+the+file+becomes+large.+These+chunks+are+organized+into+pages.+The+size+of+the+chunks+can+be+adjusted+to+be+larger+or+smaller+using+the+\"chrSze835\"+variable,+depending+on+your+device's+capabilities.+This+will+increase+the+page+sizes+(WARNING-+Do+not+adjust+this+to+be+over+50000+or+it+may+cause+issues).Tap+the+\"↪\"+icon+to+turn+the+page.\n\n-+Split+entries:\nDue+to+the+\"chunking\"+method+mentioned+above,+it+is+possible+for+an+entry+to+be+split+between+two+pages.+If+an+entry+is+cut+off+at+the+end+or+beginning+of+a+page,+it+is+likely+a+\"split+entry\"+and+will+be+temporarily+unavailable+for+deletion.+Split+entries+are+marked+in+the+corner+of+the+block+and+will+not+display+the+delete+tab.\n\n",
             "textAlignment": "Start",
             "textColor": -1,
             "textSize": "12",
             "visibilityVariable": {
              "varName": "shwInfo534"
             }
            },
            "guid": -4841338429072137183,
            "iconRes": 2131232676,
            "lastRefreshValue": 0
