             "enableSelection": false,
             "htmlFormatting": false,
             "isBold": false,
             "isItalic": false,
             "maxLines": "3",
             "maxLinesEnabled": false,
             "text": "Editing-mode:\nTap+a+note+to+enter+Editing-mode.+Notes+are+limited+to+5000+characters+due+limitations+of+the+http+trigger.\n\n-+Pinning:\nHold+a+note+to+pin/unpin+it+to+the+top+of+the+list.+Pinned+entries+will+not+be+selectable+for+deletion.\n\n-+Delete+Mode:+\nTo+delete+an+entry,+hold+the+line+icon+in+the+top+corner+of+the+text+box+to+activate+delete+mode.+While+in+delete+mode,+a+\"Select+All\"+button+and+a+trash+can+icon+(\"🗑\")+will+appear+at+the+top+of+the+page.+Tap+an+entry+to+highlight+or+unhighlight+it+for+deletion.+Tap+the+trash+button+to+confirm+and+delete+the+selected+entries.It+will+delete+the+first+occurrence+of+a+duplicate+entry+unless+the+duplicates+are+also+highlighted.\n\n-+Scrollbar:\nOn+entry+boxes+with+large+text+entries+that+exceed+the+\"box+size\"+limit,+a+scrollbar+will+appear+on+the+side+of+the+textbox.+Use+this+to+scroll+the+text.\n\n",
